1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,325
Finance rejects your expense report over one missing receipt.

2
00:00:04,275 --> 00:00:06,387
Your jaw tightens.

3
00:00:06,387 --> 00:00:11,637
You want to prove you followed the rule, but anger will not get the reimbursement approved.

4
00:00:11,637 --> 00:00:15,537
The Stoic move is to separate correction from insult.

5
00:00:15,537 --> 00:00:17,650
A form came back.

6
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:19,587
That is the event.

7
00:00:19,587 --> 00:00:25,387
The story that you are being disrespected is your judgment, and you can examine it before you act.

8
00:00:25,387 --> 00:00:30,262
Open the report, find the exact line, and fix only that line.

9
00:00:30,262 --> 00:00:35,850
If the policy is unclear, ask one precise question and attach the missing proof.

10
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:39,925
Calm precision moves paperwork faster than wounded pride.

11
00:00:39,925 --> 00:00:42,937
Take the correction before you take offense.

12
00:00:42,937 --> 00:00:48,350
